// The Overlook (Overlook_2): first sight of the Greyfold from outside (bible 8.2, [F 4.6]).

title: Overlook_Runa
---
Runa: There. The white. We counted it, once. Wider by a wingspan a year. #face:grave #line:06ca78b
Runa: Then we stopped counting. Then Mother started again. #plant:4.6 #face:grave #line:0202cb8
-> It's bigger than it looks from the Edge. #line:02f62d4
    <<voice surveyor emberdown>>
    Runa: Everything is, from inside. That's why we count from out here. #line:08c7d28
-> Somebody I know walked into it. #line:0d151dd
    <<voice drift emberdown>>
    Runa: Then say their name at the bell tonight. We'll hold it for you till you're back. #face:bright #line:05fd0c8
-> ... #line:03a142b
    <<voice drift emberdown>>
    Runa: I know. Nobody says anything, the first time. #face:grave #line:0919d51
Runa: The road down goes to the bridges. Halden. We don't go. The bridges count tolls, not birds. #face:wary #line:029b3dc
<<flag emberdown.overlook.seen 1>>
===
